      <h2 class="sec-title">Selected <em>work</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Applications I've designed, built, and tested — across web, mobile, desktop, and embedded systems.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="filters reveal" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects by technology">
      <button class="filter is-active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
      <button class="filter" data-filter="react" aria-pressed="false">React</button>
      <button class="filter" data-filter="java" aria-pressed="false">Java</button>
